{"architectures":["x64","x86"],"id":"Genesys.GenesysCloud","latestVersion":"2.56.933.0","media":{"icons":[],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Open Genesys Cloud automatically at startup and run it in the background.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://www.genesys.com/company/legal/terms-of-use","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Open Genesys Cloud automatically at startup and run it in the background.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://www.genesys.com/company/legal/terms-of-use","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"The Genesys Cloud desktop app is available for Windows and Mac:\n- Use a dedicated application. Run Genesys Cloud as a stand-alone program, and keep it separate from your browser windows and tabs.\n- Start Genesys Cloud automatically. Automatically open Genesys Cloud when your computer starts up, and avoid missing important communications.\n- Run in silent mode. Close the window but continue to run Genesys Cloud in the background, allowing you to continue receiving chats and notifications.\n- Update automatically. The desktop app notifies you when a newer version is available and prompts you to refresh or install it.","name":"GenesysCloud","packageUrl":"https://help.mypurecloud.com/articles/desktop-app/","publisher":"Genesys Inc.","publisherUrl":"https://www.genesys.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://help.mypurecloud.com/release-notes-home/genesys-cloud-for-windows-desktop-app-release-notes/","tags":[]},"zh-CN":{"description":"在开机时自动打开 Genesys Cloud 并在后台运行。","license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Genesys Cloud 桌面应用支持 Windows 和 Mac 系统：\n- 专属应用。将 Genesys Cloud 作为独立程序运行，与浏览器窗口和标签页分离。\n- 开机自启。电脑开机时自动打开 Genesys Cloud，避免错过重要通讯。\n- 静默运行。关闭窗口后仍可在后台持续运行，继续接收聊天消息和通知。\n- 自动更新。当有新版本可用时，桌面应用会通知并提示您刷新或安装。","tags":[]}},"longDescription":"The Genesys Cloud desktop app is available for Windows and Mac:\n- Use a dedicated application. Run Genesys Cloud as a stand-alone program, and keep it separate from your browser windows and tabs.\n- Start Genesys Cloud automatically. Automatically open Genesys Cloud when your computer starts up, and avoid missing important communications.\n- Run in silent mode. Close the window but continue to run Genesys Cloud in the background, allowing you to continue receiving chats and notifications.\n- Update automatically. The desktop app notifies you when a newer version is available and prompts you to refresh or install it.","name":"GenesysCloud","packageUrl":"https://help.mypurecloud.com/articles/desktop-app/","publisher":"Genesys Inc.","publisherUrl":"https://www.genesys.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://help.mypurecloud.com/release-notes-home/genesys-cloud-for-windows-desktop-app-release-notes/","tags":[]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.56.933.0/app.json","detailSha256":"e03a6ae2da1dc294bd628871e5b193b557d731b2bece3f2e938d77284729100d","releaseDate":"2026-10-12","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"2.56.933.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.56.933/app.json","detailSha256":"e3d59a0ec30a6b3dc8d656bbf326cc0455f8275678ef11cf4834c247709ff3a6","version":"2.56.933"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.55.931.0/app.json","detailSha256":"ba502706c4031733e1a9c22ffb3d3bd81befe6b4f9f0e35a15ef06da4327fe95","releaseDate":"2026-09-21","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"2.55.931.0"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/2.53.923.0/app.json","detailSha256":"21e8b41929a73f5d49f013e53e140add821732dc2c768894fcefdbb6c49b0ff7","version":"2.53.923.0"},{"architectures":["x86"],"detailPath":"versions/2.51.916.0/app.json","detailSha256":"1596069e4ad25600b00f00360cc2dd221a91478e6459ca85dbc80d7f7549ffc5","releaseDate":"2026-06-22","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"2.51.916.0"},{"architectures":["x86"],"detailPath":"versions/2.51.912.0/app.json","detailSha256":"f1d97b79c2e0f74aac3ca4b807d3af99e6f79306823eb3d71298be89817ec6c1","releaseDa